WEBVTT

01:30.120 --> 01:33.039
If the bad emperor can keep the Shen family,

01:34.039 --> 01:35.720
why bother to marry me?

01:49.920 --> 01:50.720
Your Highness.

01:52.400 --> 01:54.400
The late emperor of Fengyi Palace ordered

01:54.400 --> 01:56.479
to bury Her Majesty.

01:57.280 --> 01:59.039
The eunuch

01:59.039 --> 02:01.200
to bring white ribbon and wine.

02:09.280 --> 02:10.759
You asked someone

02:10.759 --> 02:12.320
to go to Fengyi Palace to announce the edict.

02:12.720 --> 02:13.480
I...

02:19.720 --> 02:21.079
Your Highness.

02:21.079 --> 02:23.120
I didn't send anyone

02:23.240 --> 02:26.280
but following the late emperor's will.

02:26.360 --> 02:28.160
The late emperor once ordered

02:28.240 --> 02:29.520
If he dies,

02:29.640 --> 02:32.800
you must go to Fengyi Palace immediately to deliver the decree.

02:32.880 --> 02:34.440
and order Her Majesty to be buried with her.

02:34.600 --> 02:36.720
We can't let her live.

02:36.760 --> 02:39.800
Shen's Camp belongs to the royal family of Liao.

02:39.960 --> 02:44.480
Only in this way can our country be secured forever.

02:51.280 --> 02:52.280
Your Highness.

02:52.920 --> 02:54.480
Since you are so obedient,

02:58.040 --> 03:00.320
you should leave with the late emperor.

03:06.560 --> 03:09.200
The late emperor was very thoughtful.

03:09.840 --> 03:10.800
Your Highness.

03:10.960 --> 03:11.920
Fool.

03:25.160 --> 03:25.960
Your Highness.

03:26.360 --> 03:27.160
Have you got the Royal Seal?

03:27.240 --> 03:28.040
Yes.

03:28.280 --> 03:28.760
Let's go.

03:29.880 --> 03:31.280
We have the ledger and the jade seal.

03:31.640 --> 03:32.200
Ji Hong Zhen.

03:32.640 --> 03:33.600
Even if you take the throne,

03:33.760 --> 03:34.840
don't try to force me.

03:38.640 --> 03:39.440
Stop!

03:46.600 --> 03:48.720
The late emperor really thinks highly of me.

03:48.760 --> 03:50.200
Not only did he order to be buried with me,

03:50.520 --> 03:52.240
but also arranged an ambush.

04:09.800 --> 04:10.600
Stop!

04:11.120 --> 04:11.920
Stop!

04:20.880 --> 04:23.040
Why didn't the people who came to help come?

04:30.720 --> 04:31.600
Mother.

04:31.600 --> 04:32.760
Why are you in such a hurry?

04:32.760 --> 04:33.800
Where are you going?

04:35.240 --> 04:37.240
Are you here to kill me too?

04:37.240 --> 04:38.040
Kill you?

04:39.120 --> 04:41.159
How can I bear to do that?

04:41.560 --> 04:42.320
I know.

04:42.320 --> 04:43.360
Father has issued a will.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.280
But it doesn't matter.

04:44.280 --> 04:45.560
Father has passed away.

04:45.560 --> 04:46.440
As long as you are willing,

04:46.640 --> 04:47.880
the Empress of Liao

04:48.080 --> 04:49.000
is still yours.

04:50.040 --> 04:50.880
Ji Hongzhen.

04:51.080 --> 04:52.159
Are you crazy?

04:53.920 --> 04:54.720
Yes.

04:55.200 --> 04:56.159
I'm sick.

04:56.520 --> 04:57.960
Since I first met you,

04:58.400 --> 05:00.000
I'm dying of illness.

05:00.520 --> 05:01.480
Shen Mingyue,

05:01.480 --> 05:03.560
Only I and you are the best match in this world.

05:03.560 --> 05:04.480
Only I...

05:05.280 --> 05:06.280
is incurable.

05:08.800 --> 05:10.080
Your Majesty, stay.

05:10.560 --> 05:11.840
Kill the rest.

05:19.640 --> 05:20.600
They're not on the same side.

05:22.640 --> 05:23.440
Let's go.

05:31.640 --> 05:32.440
Puppet Jutsu!

05:46.640 --> 05:47.440
Don't hurt Mother.

05:55.840 --> 05:56.840
Your Highness, go!

06:05.800 --> 06:06.720
Mother.

06:06.720 --> 06:08.600
Isn't it good to stay in the palace with me?

06:08.600 --> 06:09.960
I just changed my identity.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.400
The position of empress is yours.

06:11.400 --> 06:12.200
and power.

06:12.200 --> 06:14.160
and the glory and wealth are all yours.

06:14.400 --> 06:15.120
Okay?

06:15.480 --> 06:17.040
The white ribbon and poison aren't enough.

06:17.600 --> 06:19.560
You even arranged assassins to ambush.

06:19.560 --> 06:21.000
You didn't even want to spare my life.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.320
Ao Jia.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.560
You're finally here.

06:44.120 --> 06:44.920
How come?

06:47.080 --> 06:48.280
Shen Mingyue.

06:48.280 --> 06:49.840
Where do you think you can go?

06:49.840 --> 06:51.120
Even if you escape to the Shen Family,

06:51.159 --> 06:52.840
will Shen Lian let you go?

06:52.840 --> 06:54.760
You will still be in my hands.

06:54.880 --> 06:56.520
You will come back.

06:56.960 --> 06:58.600
Ah!

07:05.320 --> 07:06.120
General.

07:06.800 --> 07:08.040
There is indeed a disaster in the palace.

07:08.280 --> 07:09.400
His Majesty has passed away.

07:12.960 --> 07:13.920
Did you do it?

07:17.000 --> 07:17.800
No.

07:18.800 --> 07:20.520
You seem unstable.

07:21.080 --> 07:21.960
What happened?

07:23.160 --> 07:25.320
I had a relapse last night.

07:25.600 --> 07:26.680
Are you all right?

07:28.080 --> 07:28.880
I’m fine.

07:33.720 --> 07:34.840
It’s Baili Jinghong.

07:35.320 --> 07:36.760
How dare he poison you?

07:40.360 --> 07:41.880
I was controlled by Baili Jinghong.

07:42.240 --> 07:43.280
I was poisoned.

07:44.840 --> 07:45.840
That was

07:47.400 --> 07:48.600
before I met you.

07:49.440 --> 07:50.680
[before I met you.]

07:52.120 --> 07:53.240
the HyLian family

07:53.400 --> 07:55.000
is guilty.

07:55.640 --> 07:57.000
You are weak,

07:57.280 --> 08:00.440
but you have the talent to explore the gold mine.

08:00.760 --> 08:02.360
That's why Ji employed you

08:02.560 --> 08:04.080
and treated you like nothing.

08:04.720 --> 08:07.440
But our Shen family has gone down the drain.

08:08.200 --> 08:11.120
The Imperial Family took a way to deal with the warriors

08:11.720 --> 08:13.760
and started to turn their back on us.

08:15.360 --> 08:17.560
The Shen family is born with an eagle eye.

08:17.560 --> 08:18.600
with outstanding eyesight.

08:19.240 --> 08:20.480
In the name of a god archer,

08:20.600 --> 08:21.880
in the name of the country.

08:22.320 --> 08:24.320
and expand the territory for the Ji family.

08:25.320 --> 08:26.920
His Ji's empire is stable.

08:27.400 --> 08:29.520
he will kill us now.

08:33.480 --> 08:34.280
Jin.

08:35.159 --> 08:36.640
It's my name.

08:37.400 --> 08:38.799
You've grown up.

08:39.039 --> 08:39.840
As expected,

08:39.840 --> 08:41.200
and elegant.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.200
and beautiful.

08:44.680 --> 08:45.960
I didn't expect

08:46.320 --> 08:48.240
to have such a good son

08:48.720 --> 08:50.840
such a despicable family.

08:52.480 --> 08:53.280
Mother.

08:53.720 --> 08:55.320
I got

08:55.320 --> 08:57.360
of Baili Jinghong’s corruption case.

08:58.400 --> 08:59.360
I don’t understand.

08:59.640 --> 09:00.720
Please

09:00.880 --> 09:02.200
to tell the truth.

09:15.640 --> 09:16.840
It's fake.

09:16.840 --> 09:19.320
This girl is very smart.

09:20.880 --> 09:21.680
Mother.

09:27.160 --> 09:29.280
She came back alive.

09:30.400 --> 09:31.200
Mother.

09:31.640 --> 09:33.240
Why did you come back suddenly?

09:42.480 --> 09:43.680
This is your cousin.

09:43.680 --> 09:44.600
Zhao Jin.

09:44.600 --> 09:45.400
Lunar.

09:45.400 --> 09:46.200
My daughter.

09:49.800 --> 09:51.000
Greetings, Your Majesty.

09:57.160 --> 09:57.840
Aunt.

09:58.040 --> 09:58.840
I'll get going.

10:19.200 --> 10:20.520
Did she recognize me?

10:24.080 --> 10:26.280
When did I have such a good cousin?

10:28.120 --> 10:29.320
A distant relative.

10:30.440 --> 10:31.240
Don't worry about it.

10:32.960 --> 10:33.760
The Emperor has passed away.

10:34.080 --> 10:35.880
Why didn't you prepare for the funeral in the palace?

10:35.880 --> 10:37.040
Why did you come home?

10:39.040 --> 10:40.520
The Emperor wants me to die.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.320
I came all the way back.

10:42.320 --> 10:43.240
What?

10:50.120 --> 10:51.800
Lunar, don't worry.

10:51.800 --> 10:53.200
As long as the Heavenly Force is still here,

10:53.840 --> 10:55.360
they won't dare to come to Shen's mansion to ask for her.

10:57.520 --> 10:59.280
You got the ledger of the gold corruption case.

11:02.480 --> 11:03.280
Give me the ledger.

11:03.880 --> 11:04.800
Let me take a look.

11:10.000 --> 11:11.920
I just ran away.

11:11.920 --> 11:13.320
I have no time for the ledger.

11:15.680 --> 11:16.480
Fine.

11:17.040 --> 11:18.360
Go back to your room and rest.

11:18.880 --> 11:19.840
Don't worry.

11:19.840 --> 11:21.640
As long as the Camp is still here,

11:21.920 --> 11:23.320
no one can touch you.

11:27.680 --> 11:29.760
The ledger contains the evidence

11:29.760 --> 11:30.840
with Baili Jinghong.

11:30.920 --> 11:32.080
If I can get it,

11:32.120 --> 11:34.440
I can threaten the emperor to command the vassals.

11:38.760 --> 11:39.560
Lunar.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.960
I made your favorite lotus seed soup.

11:42.480 --> 11:43.560
Come and drink it.

11:53.120 --> 11:54.880
Why are you staring at me?

11:55.680 --> 11:57.080
Ever since I entered the palace,

11:57.600 --> 11:59.520
since I entered the palace.

11:59.920 --> 12:01.120
Aren't you too busy?

12:01.480 --> 12:03.000
And it's not convenient in the palace.

12:03.720 --> 12:04.520
Here.

12:05.000 --> 12:05.840
Eat it while it's hot.

12:32.200 --> 12:33.280
When you leave the palace,

12:33.440 --> 12:34.480
Ji Hong Zhen

12:34.680 --> 12:36.320
told me something about you.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.680
What did he say?

12:37.840 --> 12:38.880
He told me

12:39.440 --> 12:40.760
even if I escaped,

12:41.920 --> 12:43.440
you will still give me to him.

12:45.720 --> 12:46.800
What does he mean?

12:48.280 --> 12:49.320
In the palace,

12:49.920 --> 12:52.360
You were the one who withdrew the guards of the Imperial Guards.

12:53.000 --> 12:55.640
just to stop my retreat in the palace.

12:57.200 --> 12:58.400
I escaped all the way back.

12:59.720 --> 13:02.120
You didn't care about my hunt.

13:02.120 --> 13:03.200
or if I was hurt.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.200
but you only care about the ledger of the gold case.

13:07.240 --> 13:08.280
You want to kill me

13:09.520 --> 13:11.360
you want to kill me.

13:13.280 --> 13:14.640
Are you also involved?

13:22.960 --> 13:23.760
Mother.

13:24.200 --> 13:25.120
I don't understand.

13:26.640 --> 13:28.400
If you really get involved,

13:28.960 --> 13:30.400
I can help you.

13:31.200 --> 13:33.200
Why must you kill me?

13:35.000 --> 13:36.360
You said the Shen family would take over.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.240
I overcome the pain

13:38.240 --> 13:39.520
and practiced exotic arts.

13:40.000 --> 13:41.560
If the Shen family wants backup,

13:42.120 --> 13:43.800
I will marry that bastard emperor

13:43.800 --> 13:45.800
to clear the suspicion of the royal family.

13:46.560 --> 13:47.560
You want money?

13:47.560 --> 13:48.280
power

13:48.280 --> 13:50.000
and the glory of the Shen family.

13:50.400 --> 13:52.040
I can help you fight for it.

13:52.040 --> 13:53.840
I've always listened to you.

13:55.840 --> 13:57.440
The Imperial Family wants you to die.

13:57.720 --> 13:58.440
Not me.

13:58.960 --> 14:00.800
If I disobey the decree, my whole family will be executed.

14:01.880 --> 14:04.120
I can't lose the Heavenly Camp.

14:04.360 --> 14:05.520
Neither can the Shen Family.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.800
The whole Shen family

14:12.120 --> 14:14.360
You and I are the only ones left in the Shen Family.

14:19.960 --> 14:21.040
After all,

14:23.880 --> 14:26.520
you just don't want to let go of your authority.

14:39.200 --> 14:41.160
I won't give up.

14:42.120 --> 14:43.080
Cut the crap.

14:43.720 --> 14:45.480
I've trained you for so many years.

14:45.680 --> 14:47.880
I'd like to see how much you've gained.

14:54.640 --> 14:55.280
Mother.

14:55.600 --> 14:56.880
We shouldn't be enemies.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.400
Take the Royal Seal and leave.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.680
Meet at the same place outside the city.

15:51.040 --> 15:52.360
We're mother and daughter.

15:52.760 --> 15:54.600
I'm sorry.

15:55.160 --> 15:56.800
Why did you kill me?
